# {{ project_name }}

Built with vflask for structured, maintainable Flask application development.

## Setup

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run the app

```bash
vflask run
```

Or run with your own external services:

```bash
vflask run --project-root . --no-services
```

## Create a module

```bash
vflask module create products \
  -f name:string:required \
  -f price:decimal:required \
  -f sku:string:unique \
  -r admin -r editor
```

## Project commands

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `python -m app.cli run` | Start the generated app locally |
| `python -m app.cli start` | Alias for starting the app |
| `python -m app.cli push "feat: add module"` | Commit and push project changes |
| `python -m app.cli --help` | Show the generated app command list |
| `pytest -q` | Run the test suite |

